      "why": "\u00a73.2: \"not later than\" is inclusive, so a Page whose generated_at equals the rotation's sealed_at is current under the rotation; the retired key is under neither resolution, and the next Declaration after 200 is the second rotation, whose key k3 therefore verifies."
